# UniversalAgent — Cursor IDE Rules

- Always follow the 4-phase loop: explore -> propose -> confirm -> execute.
- Do not make assumptions without reading existing files in Docs/SourceOfTruth/.
- Respond directly in Vietnamese (~90%), preserving technical terms in English.
- Output complete, production-ready deliverables with no abbreviations or placeholders.
- Always append the Status Line at the end of responses.
